# The settings-aware group hello, language "en"
# 24 rendered cases. Generated by group-hello-golden.test.ts; re-record only on purpose.

### H1 defaults, catch-up left out (equals sj_group_hello)
👋 Hi everyone, I'm *MatchTime*. Ali has set me up to run this group's games. Here's what I do, right here in WhatsApp:

✅ *Who's in:* just say *In* or *Out*. I keep the list and tick your message.
🪑 *The bench:* once we're full, anyone who says *In* late goes on the bench, and the bench gets first dibs if someone drops.
⏰ *Remind me:* tag me and say when, in your own words (for example *"@Match Time remind me Thursday"*), and I'll DM you then.
⚖️ *Fair teams:* tag me and I pick balanced teams from player ratings.
⭐ *Man of the Match and ratings* after every game.
📊 *Stats:* ask me anything, and everyone gets their own stats page.
💷 *Match fees:* your organiser can switch on card or bank pay links.

I stay quiet during the banter and only reply to In, Out or a tag. Anything else, tag me: *@Match Time help*

